# ╭───═══◎◎◎═══───
# 🧺 **Packaging ignore — pnpm fragment (declared package manager: pnpm)**
# Only when package.json#packageManager declares pnpm. The workspace control plane and the install policy are development-environment surfaces; the package carries the bundle, not the resolution contracts.
# ╰───═══◎◎◎═══───
#
# pnpm-workspace.yaml — the workspace control plane; install-time contract.
pnpm-workspace.yaml
# pnpm-lock.yaml — the dependency resolution lock; install-time contract.
pnpm-lock.yaml
# .npmrc — the registry policy; development-environment surface.
.npmrc
# .node-version — the runtime pin; the CI lane resolves the toolchain from the configuration seam.
.node-version
